> To be explicit: a phase-one […] type carries or references the x402 payment it concerns, for example a quote digest or settlement anchor.

Your scope condition is met at `6b2f730`: the receipt now carries the x402 payment it concerns inside its signed and timestamped bytes (`payment`: network, asset, payer, pay_to, amount and EIP-3009 nonce; vector 47), and babyblueviper1 has issued a live receipt paid on Base whose settlement checks on chain. The Step 9 binding and JCS number points

