@src4511-ops Re [your comment](https://github.com/x402-foundation/tsc/issues/4#issuecomment-6325234018):

> We would be interested in contributing complementary authorization-binding, policy-denial and tamper-detection examples, mapped to the group’s agreed format.

Thanks for the offer. Send them in any form and we will turn them into shared conformance vectors with expected outcomes, credited to Counterroll, so other implementations can run them too. Would you be up for that?

@babyblueviper1 Re [your 55/55 run](https://github.com/x402-foundation/tsc/issues/4#issuecomment-6352331928):

